Apollo restarts when it's done.␀␀␀Restore settings?␀␀␀ -- done␀␀␀␀Three steps are recommended to get started:

- Set up WiFi: sets the clock over NTP (and enables updates and the schedule)%s
- Pair Micra: have your Bluetooth token ready
- Pair scale: Acaia, Bookoo or Varia, for brew by weight%s

